ase randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nYang Hong is the head of a non-governmental organization, and Cheng Tian is his deputy. Now they are planning a charity event, and finally decide who is in charge of the fundraising event. At a meeting, Xiao Chen puts forward his fundraising idea, but he is not sure if his idea is acceptable. During Xiao Chen's introduction, Cheng Tian glances at Yang Hong, and his expression seems to have a question, but Yang Hong nods affirmatively. After Xiao Chen finishes, Cheng Tian and Yang Hong exchange opinions in a low voice. Xiao Chen sees the mutual smile between Cheng Tian and Yang Hong afterwards, and his expression is relieved.\n\n[Question]\nWhy does Yang Hong nod affirmatively to Cheng Tian?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Yang Hong thinks Xiao Chen's fundraising plan raises a lot of funds.\nB. Yang Hong plans to let Cheng Tian take on more responsibility.\nC. Yang Hong thinks Cheng Tian does a good job in organizing.\nD. Yang Hong shows Cheng Tian that he agrees to let Xiao Chen fundraise.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0019266573906851546,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e2b7d6006945d2803485","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368183570,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:36:23","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"369eea2d93f24a17ae23ce4e4e1f0329"}